‫Till it's mended

360
00:23:31,990 --> 00:23:33,700
‫♪ Struggling and crying
‫And try not to disappear

361
00:23:33,830 --> 00:23:35,450
‫♪ It's so convenient like some magic

362
00:23:35,580 --> 00:23:37,250
‫♪ If you're the hero,
‫there's a beginning and an end

363
00:23:37,370 --> 00:23:39,330
‫♪ No matter what happens in the end,
‫it's always a happy ending

364
00:23:39,460 --> 00:23:41,370
‫♪ Then let me do what I want

365
00:23:41,500 --> 00:23:43,880
‫♪ I don't care anymore.

366
00:23:44,170 --> 00:23:45,750
‫♪ I fell headlong

367
00:23:45,880 --> 00:23:48,010
‫♪ into a zero-gravity Midnight escape

368
00:23:48,170 --> 00:23:50,930
‫♪ The Secret Behind the Secret,
‫I'm a Prisoner of that

369
00:23:51,220 --> 00:23:52,930
‫♪ Take it all with you

370
00:23:53,050 --> 00:23:55,180
‫♪ I'm celebrating life
‫with everything I've got

371
00:23:55,300 --> 00:23:58,680
‫♪ Thinking of the stars mingling together

372
00:23:58,810 --> 00:24:01,060
‫♪ I can't believe
‫someone says "I love you"

373
00:24:01,190 --> 00:24:03,650
‫♪ This night is all Wonder

374
00:24:03,770 --> 00:24:05,900
‫♪ Singing of love

375
00:24:11,110 --> 00:24:14,120
‫~♪

376
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:18,830
‫قل لي، ماذا يعني (يوني كوم)؟

377
00:24:18,870 --> 00:24:24,830
‫يعني فريد من نوعه في اللغة اللاتينية
‫وهو أيضًا لقب طيّار اتحاد بارع نفذ مئة مهمة حربيّة

378
00:24:24,960 --> 00:24:26,710
‫في الحلقة القادمة
‫معركة الطيّارين

379
00:24:26,790 --> 00:24:30,380
‫مستحيل، هل هناك تقنية مؤكّدة
‫لهزم مقاتلتنا؟